Script.script:
-- Achaea affliction reference, shared by the curing (ss) and offense (ar) -- packages. GENERATED by tools/gen_afflictions.py from tools/aff_data.py -- -- edit those, not this file. Version 2026-10-24. -- -- Load: local AFF = dofile(path .. "/afflictions.lua") (also sets global achaea_affs) -- -- Per affliction (keys are GMCP names, lowercase, no spaces): -- cures list of {how=eat|smoke|apply|sip|action|focus|time|special|none|death, -- item=, alt=(mineral/alchemical twin), loc=, cmd=, secs=} -- cmds ready-to-send commands in wiki order, e.g. {"eat ginseng"} -- GMCP Char.Afflictions.Add 'cure' is authoritative; use cmds as fallback. -- effect what it does focus FOCUS can cure it tree tree tattoo can (convention) -- blocks cure channels / actions it stops: eat smoke apply sip focus tree writhe -- clot move physical attack parry speech eq battlerage active_cures moss all -- hinders slows or weakens those without stopping them -- punishes using that channel hurts you (fulminated, guilt, rebbies...) -- blocks_cure afflictions you cannot cure while you have this one -- limb leftarm rightarm leftleg rightleg arms legs head torso -- stacks has levels or grows masks hides information from you -- timed / duration wears off (seconds when the wiki gives them) -- writhe escaped by WRITHE lock locks it is part of (see AFF.locks) -- skills / classes / venoms who gives it conflict wiki sources disagree
