          "Change any of it for the class you're on: `bs attack`, `bs raze`, `bs shatter`, `bs wield`, `bs prep` (sent on start; Pariah has pve's epitaph prep), `bs rage add`. `bs status` shows the next swing.",
          "* Spec and stance come from GMCP charstats (`Spec: ...`, `Stance: ...`). If `bs status` shows the wrong attack for a knight, Bard or Blademaster, paste me your charstats.",
