    },
    guide = {
      "",
      "Tracks what you carry, what's in the room, your containers, rift herbs and",
      "minerals, vials, pipes, wielded gear and gold. Part of the ACS family: it",
      "ships the shared core (`achaea-shared/acs_core.lua`) and installs alongside",
      "the curing (ss), offense (ar) and other packages.",
      "",
      "## Install",
      "",
      "Mudlet: **Toolbox > Package Manager > Install**, pick `build/IN.mpackage`.",
      "You should see `[in] loaded v0.1.0`. Rebuild after editing: `python3 build.py`.",
      "Tests: `lua5.1 tests/test_in.lua` (or `python3 tests/run_lua.py tests/test_in.lua`",
      "with `pip install lupa`).",
      "",
      "## The name \"in\"",
      "",
      "* In game, commands are `in <something>`. A bare `in` is left alone, so it",
      "  still moves you inward.",
      "* In Lua, `in` is a reserved word (`in.count()` is a syntax error), so the",
      "  namespace is `IN`. `_G[\"in\"]` points at the same table.",
      "",
      "## Commands",
      "",
      "| Command | What it does |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| `in inv [text]` | what you carry, with container contents nested |",
      "| `in find <text>` | search inventory and containers |",
      "| `in room` | mobs and items here, with ids |",
      "| `in rift [text]` | herb and mineral counts side by side, with totals |",
      "| `in count <herb>` | herb + mineral total and which form to use |",
      "| `in vials [show]` | sends ELIXLIST and summarises sips per fluid |",
      "| `in pipes [show]` | sends PIPELIST and lists pipes by herb |",
      "| `in weapons [show]` | sends WEAPONLIST: damage, to-hit, speed, decay, and which hand |",
      "| `in armour [show]` | sends ARMOURLIST: cutting, blunt, magical, decay, worn, and your class's best armour and shield |",
      "| `in gear` | wielded (left/right) and worn |",
      "| `in gold` | gold on hand and in bank |",
      "| `in look <container>` | refresh and list one container |",
      "| `in get <text>` / `in get gold` | pick up matching room items |",
      "| `in autogold on/off` | pick up gold whenever it appears (RM's `room pickup` does this instead when it's loaded and on) |",
      "| `in low <item> <n>` | low-stock warning level (`default`, `sips`, or an item; 0 = off) |",
      "| `in prefer herb/mineral` | which form `best_form` picks when you have both |",
      "| `in refill [plan]` | fill empty vials with whatever your vial set is missing (`plan` only shows it) |",
      "| `in want [<fluid> <n>]` | vials of each fluid in your set; `in want venoms <n>` for every venom; no args lists it |",
      "| `in refresh` | re-read inventory, room, rift, vials and pipes |",
      "",
      "Settings are saved per character (`acs_<name>_in.lua` in your Mudlet home).",
      "",
      "## For other packages",
      "",
      "```lua",
      "if IN then",
      "  IN.best_form(\"kelp\")       --> \"kelp\" or \"aurum\", whichever you have",
      "  IN.count(\"kelp\")           --> rift + loose kelp and aurum",
      "  IN.rift_count(\"potash\")    --> just that rift entry",
      "  IN.pipes_by_herb.valerian  --> pipe id to smoke",
      "  IN.vial_sips(\"health\")     --> total sips across health vials",
      "  IN.wielded.left, IN.wielded.right",
      "  IN.weapon(id)              --> { name, dmg, tohit, speed, months } from WEAPONLIST",
      "  IN.armour_piece(id)        --> { name, cutting, blunt, magical, months, type, slot }",
      "  IN.best_armour[class], IN.best_shield[class]",
      "  IN.room_items(\"mobs\")      --> live mobs here; IN.room_items() = items",
      "  IN.pickup(\"corpse\"), IN.pickup_gold()",
      "end",
      "```",
      "",
      "Events: `IN.inv.changed`(action, item), `IN.room.changed`(action, item),",
      "`IN.container.changed`(id), `IN.rift.changed`(key, amount, old),",
      "`IN.vials.changed`, `IN.pipes.changed`, `IN.weapons.changed`, `IN.armour.changed`, `IN.wield.changed`(left, right),",
      "`IN.gold.changed`(gold, delta), `IN.low`(key, amount, threshold).",
      "",
      "Rift keys are short words: \"irid moss\" is `moss`, \"prickly ash\" is `ash`.",
      "",
      "## Refilling vials",
      "",
      "`in refill` compares your last ELIXLIST with your vial set and sends",
      "`fill vial<id> with <liquid> from rift` for each missing liquid you have in",
      "the rift, or `... from tun` for the rest (be in the shop, with the gold),",
      "one empty vial each. `in refill rift` or `in refill tun` forces one source,",
      "then runs ELIXLIST again. The default set is one vial each of health, mana,",
      "immunity, levitation, speed, frost, venom, mending, restoration, epidermal,",
      "caloric and mass, plus one of every venom. Elixirs and salves get empties",
      "before venoms, and it tells you what didn't fit. Bonus vials (ogre,",
      "epicurus) are left alone. Change the set with `in want`, or the command",
      "itself with `IN.settings.refill_cmd` (default",
      "`\"fill vial{vial} with {fluid} from {source}\"`). From a script: `IN.refill()` or",
      "`IN.refill_plan()`.",
      "",
      "## Check in game",
      "",
      "Inventory, room, containers, rift and gold come from GMCP. ELIXLIST and",
      "PIPELIST parsing is tested against the output you pasted, and typing either",
      "command yourself updates the lists too. Try `in refill plan` before the",
      "first real refill.",
      "",
      "Vial sips and pipe puffs don't update as you use them (the game doesn't send",
      "that); they're as of the last list. `in refresh` re-reads everything.",
    },
