    events = {},
    guide = {
      "",
      "One panel down the side of the Mudlet window that shows what the other ACS",
      "packages know. Built on the shared ACS core (`src/00_acs_core.lua`, copied",
      "from `achaea-shared/acs_core.lua` by the build), so it installs next to ss,",
      "ar, bs, pt, rm, in and hb in any order.",
      "",
      "Every package is optional. Whatever isn't loaded is read straight from GMCP",
      "instead (vitals, afflictions and defences, room and players, rift, the",
      "in-game target), so the panel works on its own too.",
      "",
      "## Install",
      "",
      "Mudlet: **Toolbox > Package Manager > Install**, pick `build/GUI.mpackage`.",
      "You should see `[gui] loaded v0.1.0` and the panel on the right.",
      "",
      "Rebuild after editing `src/`: `python3 build.py`.",
      "Tests: `lua5.1 tests/test_gui.lua`, or `python3 tests/run_lua.py tests/test_gui.lua` (needs `pip install lupa`).",
      "The last test loads `../achaea-heartbeat/src` to check the hb wiring.",
      "",
      "## Layout",
      "",
      "```",
      "+-----------------------------+",
      "|             map             |   top half (gui map <pct>)",
      "+--------------+--------------+",
      "| self         | target       |",
      "| HP MP EP WP  | enemy status |",
      "| bal lights   | + attackers  |",
      "+--------------+--------------+",
      "| room         | mobs         |   mobs only while bashing;",
      "|              |              |   room takes the row otherwise",
      "+--------------+--------------+",
      "```",
      "",
      "| Box | Shows | Read from |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| map | the IRE mapper's map, embedded in the panel | the mapper |",
      "| self | HP, MP, EP, WP gauges; bal/eq and herb/salve/smoke/sip/moss/focus/tree lights; bleed, rage; your afflictions, missing defences (SS keepup), defences up | GMCP `Char.Vitals`, SS, else GMCP |",
      "| target | name in PT colour with city, class and [E]/[A]; health %; lock level and outs; afflictions with AR's chance (sure ones plain, likely ones with %, possible ones grey); limb damage (red at 100%+) and what they parry; defences; their cure balances; then who's hitting you (class, hits, seconds since, affs given). Updates on every AR change and once a second | AR + PT + SS attackers, else GMCP `IRE.Target` (name and health) with PT's city/class |",
      "| room | room name and exits, the mapper's walk (destination, steps left, a [stop] link), players enemies first in PT colours with city/class and [E]/[A]; denizens when the mobs box isn't up | RM + PT + the IRE mapper, else GMCP |",
      "| mobs | only while BS is hunting: mobs here in room order (target marked with its health, ones BS will attack in orange, others grey, shields), then this session's kills, xp % and gold with minutes hunting, and your level and gold | BS, `Char.Status`, IN gold |",
      "",
      "A box that's off gives its space to the one beside it; a row with nothing",
      "in it gives its height to the other row; with the map off the grid takes",
      "the whole panel.",
      "",
      "Click a player in the room box to run `t <name>` (your AR target alias).",
      "",
      "Mudlet has only one map widget, so the map box takes the mapper's map into",
      "the panel. If you'd rather keep the map in its own window, type `gui box map off`",
      "before the panel first draws it, or turn it off and reopen the map from Mudlet's toolbar.",
      "",
      "## Commands",
      "",
      "| Command | Does |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| `gui on` / `gui off` | show or hide the panel (the main text gets its space back) |",
      "| `gui side left\\|right` | which side |",
      "| `gui width [pct]` | panel width, 10 to 60 (default 35) |",
      "| `gui map [pct]` | the map's share of the panel height (default 50) |",
      "| `gui font [size]` | text size in the boxes |",
      "| `gui box` | list boxes with on/off |",
      "| `gui box NAME on\\|off` | turn a box on or off (map, self, target, room, mobs) |",
      "| `gui border [#rrggbb]` | colour of the line around each box (default #56688c) |",
      "| `gui click on\\|off` | click-to-target in the room box |",
      "| `gui redraw` | rebuild the layout |",
      "| `gui reset` | default layout and settings |",
      "| `gui status` | settings, and which packages it's reading from |",
      "",
      "Settings are saved per character in `<Mudlet home>/acs_<name>_gui.lua`.",
      "A layout saved by the old stacked panel is replaced by this one the first",
      "time it loads; side, font, colours and click stay as you set them.",
      "",
      "## Redraws",
      "",
      "With the heartbeat package (hb) loaded, each box is an hb handler at",
      "priority 85 watching the keys for what it shows (`vitals`, `affs`, `defs`,",
      "`room`, `players`, `items`, plus `gui.self`, `gui.target`, `gui.room`,",
      "`gui.mobs`, `gui.bals` marked from the other packages'",
      "events). Vitals are `urgent`, so the gauges move on the next frame. A",
      "`gui.tick` handler runs once a second for the attacker ages and the",
      "target's cure-balance timers. Without hb, changes are batched for 0.1 s and",
      "the tick is a timer.",
      "",
      "A box is only rewritten when its text actually changed, so idle beats cost",
      "nothing on screen. `hb prof` shows what the panel costs.",
      "",
      "## Check in game",
      "",
      "Written against the Geyser API and your GMCP dump, not yet run in Mudlet:",
      "",
      "* The panel should sit flush against the main text with no overlap. If",
      "  the main text runs under it, `gui redraw`; if that doesn't fix it, tell",
      "  me your Mudlet version.",
      "* Clicking a name in the room box uses `cechoLink` with a function (Mudlet",
      "  4.x). If clicks do nothing, `gui click off` and tell me.",
      "* The gauge text is HTML inside the gauge; if it looks too big or small for",
      "  your font, say so and I'll make it follow `gui font`.",
      "",
      "## Files",
      "",
      "| File | What it does |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| `src/00_acs_core.lua` | shared ACS core (don't edit here; edit `achaea-shared/`) |",
      "| `src/01_gui.lua` | module, settings, `gui.data` (one reader per box, package or GMCP) |",
      "| `src/02_render.lua` | turns the data into lines for each box (no Geyser, tested) |",
      "| `src/03_layout.lua` | Geyser panel: geometry, gauges, MiniConsoles, drawing |",
      "| `src/04_commands.lua` | `gui` commands |",
      "| `src/99_init.lua` | GMCP and package events, hb handlers, resize |",
    },
